{
  "name": "Portal — the nightly chain",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 4 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "04:00 every night",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "After the 02:30 caption analysis and the 03:30 ad sync, so the night's three AI jobs read a database nothing else is still writing to."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://nvkhub.vercel.app/api/automation/insights/sync",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0010-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Pull post insights",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Reach, likes, saves and shares for every published post. First, because the two below read what it writes — a Brain run on yesterday's numbers explains yesterday. Replace PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE with the CRON_SECRET from deploy/.env — the same value every other portal workflow uses."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "status-not-ok-sync",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0011-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Did sync fail?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://nvkhub.vercel.app/api/automation/insights/brain",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0012-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Work out what changed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "The Marketing Brain: what moved for each client this week and why. Needs the sync above to have run tonight. Replace PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE with the CRON_SECRET from deploy/.env — the same value every other portal workflow uses."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "status-not-ok-brain",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0013-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Did brain fail?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://nvkhub.vercel.app/api/automation/decisions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 90000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0014-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "name": "Decide tomorrow's list",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        640,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "The night shift. Reads the Brain's findings and the money and work boards, and puts what needs a person into the notification bell. Replace PASTE_CRON_SECRET_HERE with the CRON_SECRET from deploy/.env — the same value every other portal workflow uses."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "status-not-ok-decisions",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0015-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "name": "Did decisions fail?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "errorType": "errorMessage",
        "errorMessage": "=A step of the nightly chain returned {{ $json.statusCode }}: {{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"
      },
      "id": "c1a1b2c3-0099-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Stop and report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -180
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
